WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.190
A role is created and assigned the access

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.949
required for personnel working in that role.

3
00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:11.270
When a user takes on a job, the administrator assigns them to the appropriate role.

4
00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:15.140
If a user leaves that role,

5
00:00:15.149 --> 00:00:18.500
the administrator removes that user and then access for

6
00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:21.479
that user associated with that role is removed.

7
00:00:22.379 --> 00:00:24.780
Aach works well in an environment with high staff

8
00:00:24.790 --> 00:00:28.790
turnover and multiple personnel with similar access requirements.